      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg my 18 month old is burning up so bad... temp is 103.6 and he just wont stop screaming. hes only 11kg. i have the tylenol 160mg/5ml and i was thinking if i just give him a big 12ml dose all at once it might finally knock the fever down so he can sleep? i really dont want to have to deal with the er tonight if i can just fix it here... is that 12ml dose okay to just use once to get him under control??",
